{
  "story_id": "house-of-clocks",
  "chapter": 2,
  "total_duration_ms": 127560,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Wren did not move.",
      "start_ms": 2160,
      "end_ms": 3394
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "She was standing in the hallway.",
      "start_ms": 3394,
      "end_ms": 5431
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "She did not remember getting out of bed.",
      "start_ms": 5431,
      "end_ms": 7961
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "She did not remember walking down the stairs.",
      "start_ms": 7961,
      "end_ms": 10800
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "But she was there now, in the dark, in her nightgown, facing the wall at the end of the corridor.",
      "start_ms": 10800,
      "end_ms": 16910
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "The backwards clock was just above her head.",
      "start_ms": 16910,
      "end_ms": 19749
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Behind her, she could feel something.",
      "start_ms": 19749,
      "end_ms": 22094
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Not a hand.",
      "start_ms": 22094,
      "end_ms": 22834
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Not a breath.",
      "start_ms": 22834,
      "end_ms": 23698
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Just the sense that the hallway, which should have been empty, was not.",
      "start_ms": 23698,
      "end_ms": 28203
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "\"Please.\"",
      "start_ms": 28203,
      "end_ms": 28882
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "The voice was so soft that Wren was not sure she had heard it.",
      "start_ms": 28882,
      "end_ms": 32770
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "It was a child's voice.",
      "start_ms": 32770,
      "end_ms": 34251
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "A boy, she thought.",
      "start_ms": 34251,
      "end_ms": 35486
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Younger than her, maybe eight or nine.",
      "start_ms": 35486,
      "end_ms": 37954
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "\"Please.",
      "start_ms": 37954,
      "end_ms": 38510
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "I need help.\"",
      "start_ms": 38510,
      "end_ms": 39435
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Wren swallowed.",
      "start_ms": 39435,
      "end_ms": 40423
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Every part of her wanted to turn around.",
      "start_ms": 40423,
      "end_ms": 42953
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Every part of her remembered what Great-Aunt Marlow had said.",
      "start_ms": 42953,
      "end_ms": 46779
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "She kept her eyes on the backwards clock and did not move.",
      "start_ms": 46779,
      "end_ms": 50482
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "\"Who are you?\" she whispered.",
      "start_ms": 50482,
      "end_ms": 52395
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "\"I don't know,\" said the boy.",
      "start_ms": 52395,
      "end_ms": 54247
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "\"I don't remember.",
      "start_ms": 54247,
      "end_ms": 55419
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "I've been in the clock so long that I forgot.\"",
      "start_ms": 55419,
      "end_ms": 58382
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "\"The clock?\"",
      "start_ms": 58382,
      "end_ms": 59246
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "\"The backwards one.",
      "start_ms": 59246,
      "end_ms": 60480
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "My great-grandfather made it, and then something went wrong, and I got — stuck.",
      "start_ms": 60480,
      "end_ms": 65417
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "I only come out when it strikes thirteen.",
      "start_ms": 65417,
      "end_ms": 68009
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "I only have a minute.",
      "start_ms": 68009,
      "end_ms": 69367
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Please.\"",
      "start_ms": 69367,
      "end_ms": 69984
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Wren realized she was holding her breath.",
      "start_ms": 69984,
      "end_ms": 72576
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "She let it out, very slowly.",
      "start_ms": 72576,
      "end_ms": 74427
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "\"How do I help you?\" she asked.",
      "start_ms": 74427,
      "end_ms": 76464
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "\"There is a key,\" the boy said, and his voice was getting quieter.",
      "start_ms": 76464,
      "end_ms": 80599
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "\"The key that winds the backwards clock.",
      "start_ms": 80599,
      "end_ms": 83129
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "If you can find it, and turn it the right way, the clock will run forward again.",
      "start_ms": 83129,
      "end_ms": 88128
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "And I will be free.\"",
      "start_ms": 88128,
      "end_ms": 89486
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "\"Where is the key?\"",
      "start_ms": 89486,
      "end_ms": 90782
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "There was a long silence.",
      "start_ms": 90782,
      "end_ms": 92386
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Wren thought he might have gone.",
      "start_ms": 92386,
      "end_ms": 94423
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Then, right at her ear, so quiet it was almost a thought:",
      "start_ms": 94423,
      "end_ms": 98064
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "\"It's in Great-Aunt Marlow's bedroom.",
      "start_ms": 98064,
      "end_ms": 100409
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "In the music box on her dresser.\"",
      "start_ms": 100409,
      "end_ms": 102569
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Wren's heart sank.",
      "start_ms": 102569,
      "end_ms": 103803
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "\"But she can never know,\" the boy whispered.",
      "start_ms": 103803,
      "end_ms": 106581
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "\"She would stop you.",
      "start_ms": 106581,
      "end_ms": 107877
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Please.",
      "start_ms": 107877,
      "end_ms": 108370
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Promise me.\"",
      "start_ms": 108370,
      "end_ms": 109234
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "\"Why would she stop me?\"",
      "start_ms": 109234,
      "end_ms": 110839
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "But the boy did not answer.",
      "start_ms": 110839,
      "end_ms": 112567
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "The pressure behind her — the not-quite-breath, the not-quite-hand — was gone.",
      "start_ms": 112567,
      "end_ms": 117504
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Slowly, slowly, Wren turned around.",
      "start_ms": 117504,
      "end_ms": 119664
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "The hallway was empty.",
      "start_ms": 119664,
      "end_ms": 121271
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "The clocks ticked their soft rain.",
      "start_ms": 121271,
      "end_ms": 123717
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "The moonlight lay quietly on the floor.",
      "start_ms": 123717,
      "end_ms": 126582
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "She was alone.",
      "start_ms": 126582,
      "end_ms": 127560
    }
  ]
}